   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "dispatchGameCommand is a lookup table, not a switch:\n  const handlers = { 'pick-clue': pickClue, buzz, ... }\nAdding a command is one line, and nothing can fall through.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "dispatchGameCommand is a lookup table, not a switch:\n  const handlers = { 'pick-clue': pickClue, buzz, ... }\nAdding a command is one line, and nothing can fall through.",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "e0097",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 660,
   "y": 1240,
   "width": 700,
   "height": 64,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0097",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 119988829,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1200093500,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every handler is the same two moves:\n  refuse(state, command, [ [rule, code, message], ... ])\n  editClue(state, now, (clue, draft) => { ...; return events })\nThe guard ladders that used to open each one are now a table.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Every handler is the same two moves:\n  refuse(state, command, [ [rule, code, message], ... ])\n  editClue(state, now, (clue, draft) => { ...; return events })\nThe guard ladders that used to open each one are now a table.",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
